  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a trade with Lang Ya land spirit, Fang Yuan gives away Paradise Earth’s true inheritance among other Shadow Sect collected inheritances, while taking Lang Ya Sect inheritances in return.",
      "chapters": [
        1447
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He already holds a clue to Paradise Earth’s true inheritance that Tang clan had surrendered for help, but he sets that prize aside while focusing on Thieving Heaven’s dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        1490
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tang-clan-clue",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_tang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a failed reforming attempt, Tie Mian Shen asks whether Lu Wei Yin, skilled in earth path, is the inheritor of Paradise Earth’s true inheritance, and Lu Wei Yin confirms that he is. Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable had no offensive methods, and his Paradise Earth true inheritance is the same; Lu Wei Yin’s trapping and reforming of enemies is that specialty. Among the ten venerables he is called the kindest and most merciful, and he stayed in Southern Border and left his Paradise Earth true inheritance there rather than going to Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        1548
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-inheritor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_mian_shen",
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan treats Lu Wei Yin as Southern Border’s current generation inheritor of Paradise Earth, and he seeks the Paradise Earth true inheritance inside the blue dragon whale partly as a way to deal with Lu Wei Yin.",
      "chapters": [
        1649
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blue-dragon-whale-search",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_blue_dragon_whale"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortals exploring that grotto-heaven already know Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable subdued the blue dragon whale, awakened its immortal aperture, and left a Paradise Earth true inheritance there.",
      "chapters": [
        1651
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merit-obelisk-missions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On one island, Merit Obelisk text introduces the background and the details of that Paradise Earth true inheritance, and obtaining it requires accepting missions for merit points that can be exchanged for more valuable rewards.",
      "chapters": [
        1891
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merit-obelisk-missions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_merit_obelisk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lu Wei Yin states that Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable left main true inheritances in the five regions: Southern Border’s at their present site, Eastern Sea’s in the blue dragon whale, Central Continent’s as Reincarnation Battlefield, Northern Plains’ inside the Yellow Earth Great World, and Western Desert’s, which someone seems to have taken already. After Fang Yuan agrees to help revive Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable, Lu Wei Yin hands over Southern Border’s Paradise Earth true inheritance, including Mushroomman Paradise as territory, more than ten mostly earth path Immortal Gu, and an information path Immortal Gu that records the details. That true inheritance has three components: an earth path main part with core killer move paradise creation that ends calamities and tribulations in the immortal aperture; a human path part that is the Virtue true inheritance Fang Yuan met in the reforming dream; and a dream path part whose core killer move is three lifetime dreams reform a chosen one, built on fetus earth maze.",
      "chapters": [
        2087
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "regional-placements",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "move_reincarnation_battlefield",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_yellow_earth_great_world",
        "reg_western_desert",
        "loc_mushroomman_paradise",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "inh_virtue_true_inheritance"
      ]
    }
  ],
